3. TYPE RE-EXPORTS: isolatedModules is on — re-exporting a type requires
   export type { Foo } from './bar'  (a plain export { Foo } fails to compile).
4. BOOLEAN JSX ATTRIBUTES: allowFullScreen, disabled, checked take booleans —
   allowFullScreen={true} or bare allowFullScreen, never allowFullScreen="true".
5. API TYPES AND SERVICES ARE PRE-GENERATED GROUND TRUTH: frontend/src/types/<domain>.ts
   and frontend/src/services/<domain>Service.ts are DERIVED from the backend contract and
   already exist. Their real content appears in your dependency context: import the
